fields.description:
Vinnytsia School of Hardcore, ambassadors of Ramen Metal, brand names who have gone through the entire thorny path of the stages of the Fine City, are embarking on the largest all-Ukrainian tour in the entire history of the band's existence in support of the new mini-album "1995"!

“1995 is the date of the foundation of Sik;
1995 is Dusya, Tokha, Pasha and Tyoma;
1995 is our mutual values ​​and experiences;
1995 is us, but more depressed and sincere;
1995 is new songs and concerts;
1995 is the anniversary of the Vinnytsia school of hardcore, to which you are invited,” the band comments.

This fall, a mosaic of small tours will form a grand map of cities where Sika will share the happiness of playing new hits and time-tested bangers. Find your city, get your tickets, we'll hear from you soon👹

Part of the proceeds will be transferred to the needs of the Azov State University brigade 🇺🇦
